# 9. Distinct dollar-neutral universe and a verified recovery case.
f=family('dollar_neutral','ETH-backed dollar-neutral products and recovery',['E9','extended USD scope'],'Ethena and the historical Resolv design combine crypto collateral with short futures. The shorts offset ETH/BTC price exposure; collateral staking and derivative carry can contribute income. The dollar receipt is different from an ETH-long vault.',['Ethereum staking where ETH collateral is used','Futures counterparties through funding or basis convergence','Borrower interest or stable-asset returns where deployed'],'Targets dollar neutrality, not preservation of ETH upside. Whole USDe/USR value cannot be called ETH strategy capital without a collateral and hedge decomposition.','USD total return includes staking, funding/basis, collateral income and derivative marks, less hedge losses, custody/trading costs, fees and impairments. Negative funding can reverse the carry.','sUSDe unstaking returns USDe after its documented cooldown, not ETH. Rewards are discretionary under the current Ethena mechanism. Offchain hedge and collateral liquidity affect cash redemption. Resolv published pre-incident ordinary redemption terms must not be presented as an active exit policy after its March 2026 recovery transition.','Centralized trading/custody counterparties and protocol roles control collateral, hedge and mint/redeem operations. Resolv is paused and in recovery according to current official docs.',['Exchange/custody failure','Hedge liquidation','Negative funding','Basis and collateral mismatch','Mint authorization and recovery restrictions'],'Exchange risk limits, available open interest, collateral liquidity and basis demand. Market size does not imply an ETH-only neutral strategy can absorb all that capital.','Actual funding and collateral income can remain without token rewards, but they are cyclical. Sustainable yield requires realized positive net carry and adequate reserves, not an assumed fixed yield.','Extended USD universe identified. Ethena whole-product discovery value is not an ETH sleeve. Resolv has a documented historical failure/recovery case, but its current ETH collateral and eligible recovery value are unmeasured.',['ethena_overview','ethena_derivatives','ethena_rewards','ethena_staking','ethena_addresses','resolv_collateral','resolv_futures','resolv_fees','resolv_contracts','resolv_recovery','resolv_deprecated'])
product(f,'ethena_susde','Ethena sUSDe','Ethereum / multichain',[],'USD','Large existing discovery product; ETH sleeve remains unmeasured',['ethena_overview','ethena_derivatives','ethena_rewards','ethena_staking','ethena_addresses'],[observation(feed('ethena-usde','SUSDE'),'whole USD staking product, not ETH collateral NAV')],extra={'excludedFromETHPrincipal':True,'primaryProductSources':[url('ethena_overview'),url('ethena_derivatives')],'sourceQualification':'Ethena primary overview and derivative documentation support the dollar-neutral mechanism; current ETH allocation is not measured.'})
product(f,'resolv_recovery','Resolv USR / RLP recovery','Ethereum',[],'USD and recovery rights','Paused / recovery, as described by current official documentation',['resolv_recovery','resolv_contracts','resolv_deprecated'],events=[{'date':'2026-03-22','event':'Official recovery documentation dates the incident and transition to recovery.','sourceURLs':[url('resolv_recovery')]},{'date':'2026-09-26','event':'Extended claims deadline stated in the recovery documentation; it precedes frozen T.','sourceURLs':[url('resolv_recovery')]},{'date':'2025-11-03','event':'TAC USR vault deprecation is separately documented; it is not the same event as the March incident.','sourceURLs':[url('resolv_deprecated')]}],extra={'excludedFromETHPrincipal':True})
# 10. Custodial and securities-based ETH staking access.
f=family('offchain_staking','Exchange and listed-fund staking access',['E1','extended offchain scope'],'WBETH represents Binance-managed ETH staking with an accruing ETH conversion ratio. ETHE and ETH are listed securities holding ETH and participating in staking; the retail holder owns shares rather than an onchain redemption claim.',['Ethereum issuance, priority fees and validator economics'],'ETH long, through custodial receipts or securities. Exchange balances and WBETH backing overlap; fund shares and the ETH they hold are also the same capital at different layers.','WBETH return is ETH conversion-ratio growth after reward commissions. Listed-fund investor total return includes share-price changes and distributions, less fund and staking costs; market discounts or premiums differ from NAV return.','WBETH redemption is quota- and queue-dependent and cannot be cancelled once requested. Retail ETF holders normally sell shares in the market; Authorized Participant creations/redemptions are a separate channel.','Custodian, exchange and sponsor policies replace much of onchain role visibility. Binance reserves discretion to change its reward commission without advance notice. The 2025 ETHE annual filing states a 2.5% annual sponsor fee and aggregate 23% of gross staking rewards for sponsor/custodian/provider; those dated terms are not a fresh October 2026 policy audit.',['Custody and counterparty risk','Withdrawal restrictions','Fund share discount/premium','Staking penalties','Fee drag'],'Exchange quotas, validator exit queues and custody/provider capacity. Fund market depth differs from underlying ETH redemption liquidity.','Native staking earnings do not require promotions. WBETH Flexible Simple Earn does not add a second yield merely because it appears in another product menu. Fees can consume a substantial portion of gross staking return.','Official exchange terms and historical public fund filing reviewed. Product-level current custodial assets and October policy amendments remain outside frozen-T reconstruction.',['binance_wbeth_web','binance_fee_web','grayscale_10k_web'])
product(f,'wbeth','Binance WBETH','Ethereum / BNB Chain',[contract('0xa2e3356610840701bdf5611a53974510ae27e2e1')],'ETH','Current official staking terms reviewed 4 October',['binance_wbeth_web','binance_fee_web'],[observation(feed('binance-staked-eth','WBETH'))],events=[{'date':'2023-04-27','event':'WBETH launch dated in the official support FAQ.','sourceURLs':[url('binance_wbeth_web')]}],extra={'fees':'Official fee FAQ lists a standard 10% staking reward commission for reference, with unilateral changes permitted without advance notice; token conversion/redemption has no separate stated charge.'})
